<view class="page-shell roleplay-result-page" wx:if="{{!loading}}">
  <view class="result-hero">
    <text class="result-kicker">患者模拟完成 · {{scenario.name}}</text>
    <view class="hero-icon"><text>✓</text></view>
    <text class="hero-title">学习复盘已生成</text>
    <text class="result-time">{{session.startedAt}} — {{session.finishedAt}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-box"><text class="notice-icon">i</text><text>本复盘用于帮助新人理解标准客服的沟通结构与合规边界，不含数值评分，不构成医疗建议。</text></view>

  <view class="section-title-row"><text class="section-title">整体接待总结</text><text class="section-caption">一句话看懂本次练习</text></view>
  <view class="summary-card card"><text class="summary-quote">“{{summary.summary}}”</text></view>

  <view class="section-title-row"><text class="section-title">已覆盖的问题</text><text class="section-caption">{{summary.coveredTopics.length}} 项</text></view>
  <view class="list-card card">
    <view class="topic-item" wx:for="{{summary.coveredTopics}}" wx:key="*this">
      <view class="topic-dot"></view>
      <text class="topic-text">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title-row"><text class="section-title">关键服务原则</text><text class="section-caption">{{summary.keyPrinciples.length}} 条</text></view>
  <view class="principle-card card" wx:for="{{summary.keyPrinciples}}" wx:key="*this">
    <view class="principle-index">{{index + 1}}</view>
    <text class="principle-text">{{item}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title-row"><text class="section-title">后续练习建议</text></view>
  <view class="list-card card practice-card">
    <view class="topic-item" wx:for="{{summary.nextPracticeSuggestions}}" wx:key="*this">
      <view class="topic-dot topic-dot-arrow">→</view>
      <text class="topic-text">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="result-actions"><button class="primary-button" bindtap="viewScenes">再练一个场景</button><button class="secondary-button action-button" bindtap="viewHistory">查看历史记录</button></view>
  <text class="disclaimer">AI模拟训练，不构成医疗建议。</text>
</view>

<view class="page-shell roleplay-result-page loading-result" wx:if="{{loading}}">
  <view class="loading-card card">
    <view class="loading-icon">✦</view>
    <text class="loading-title">{{loadingText}}</text>
    <text class="loading-text">{{timedOut ? '任务仍在后台可靠执行，离开页面后可从历史记录继续查看。' : '复盘会读取完整问答并整理学习重点，请稍候。'}}</text>
    <button wx:if="{{retryable}}" class="primary-button retry-button" bindtap="retrySummary">重新生成复盘</button>
    <button wx:if="{{timedOut}}" class="primary-button retry-button" bindtap="continueWaiting">继续等待</button>
    <button wx:if="{{timedOut}}" class="secondary-button retry-button" bindtap="viewHistory">返回历史</button>
  </view>
</view>
